<title>USA: UGI Corp increases qtly dividend to $0.36.</title>
<headline>UGI Corp increases qtly dividend to $0.36.</headline>
<dateline>VALLEY FORGE, Pa. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UGI Corp said Tuesday it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.36 per share from $0.355 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable July 1 to shareholders of record May 30.</p>
</text>
